id="history-chart-summary" class="sr-only">Latest reading 28.5°F. Range over this period: 28.5°F to 50.0°F. Dropped to or below the 34°F freeze line in 5 of 24 readings. Door-open periods shaded on the chart: Side door: 1.</p><p class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></p><details class="history-chart-tips m-0 mt-2 text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]"><summary>Chart options: guide lines, humidity</summary><form class="chart-threshold-controls"><label class="chart-threshold-field"><span>Target ambient (°F)</span><input type="number" step="0.5" class="form-input" value="40" placeholder="Optional"/></label><label class="chart-threshold-field"><span>High warning (°F)</span><input type="number" step="0.5" class="form-input" value="90" placeholder="Optional"/></label><label class="chart-threshold-field chart-threshold-check"><span>Humidity + dew</span><input type="checkbox" checked/></label><p class="chart-threshold-note mb-0">Freeze line from alerts: 34°F</p></form></details></div>"`;

